es", "text": "Assess where additional people, activity, or resources have an evidence-based rationale."}]}, "steps": [{"title": "Agree the mandate", "text": "Define the business priorities, decision responsibilities, and scope of the advisory role."}, {"title": "Establish the rhythm", "text": "Agree the working cadence, measures, and access needed to support leadership effectively."}, {"title": "Lead through the next decisions", "text": "Review progress, challenge assumptions, and keep the team focused on the next commercial step."}], "next": {"title": "Choose the support that matches the gap.", "text": "Fractional advisory support provides ongoing direction and judgment. When the main need is hands-on outreach and market execution, Market Activation may be the more appropriate starting point."}, "nextLink": {"url": "/market-activation/", "text": "Explore Market Activation"}, "faqs": [{"q": "How is this different from Market Activation?", "a": "The advisory role centers on ongoing leadership, judgment, alignment, and accountability. Market Activation centers on putting a defined commercial direction into the market through agreed execution activities."}, {"q": "How are scope, timing, and fees agreed?", "a": "We define the engagement around your starting point, priorities, and available resources. Scope, timing, responsibilities, and fees are agreed before work begins."}, {"q": "What does our team need to contribute?", "a": "Access to leadership, product and customer knowledge, existing commercial materials, and people who can make decisions and follow through. ARONIA works alongside your team."}]};
